---
import H1 from "@components/h1.astro";
import InfoLayout from "@layouts/InfoLayout.astro";
---

<InfoLayout>
     <div class="p-4 sm:pt-8 sm:px-12 pb-20 min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between gap-32">
          <div class="space-y-4 sm:space-y-12">
               <H1> Get to know Dani </H1>

               <!--Cambiar enlace -->
               <p class="text-xl xl:text-2xl text-zinc-500 text-balance">
                    <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nikola_Tesla" target="_blank" class="underline underline-offset-4 decoration-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-50 hover:decoration-zinc-200">
                         Daniel Daryanani Delgado Perez
                    </a>
                    (2000) I'm a peculiar guy from the Canary Islands, Tenerife. I do like improving my skills in all fields.
                    My goal is just to make things greater, how I do it? Adapting myself to every situation, learning about everything, and 
                    pushing forward to achieve the best. <strong>If someone is capable of doing something, I am too. </strong>

                    Dialogue, understanding, and analysis those are the keys for understanding myself. 
                    Loyalty and apreciation comes after respect. Value the work of others to value yours.

                    <strong>Keep things dynamic and keep it in your own way. </strong>
                    
               </p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2 text-base sm:text-lg">
               <h2 class="px-4 text-zinc-400 underline underline-offset-4 decoration-zinc-500">Achievements</h2>

               <ul class="px-4 text-zinc-400 list-disc list-outside">
                    <li>Bachelor Degree in VideoGame development</li>
                    <li>Drone filmaker and editor</li>
                    <li>Experience in analysis work</li>
                    <li>QuiroPractice medium level module</li>
                    <li>Solo trip around Europe, Latam, Asia</li>
               </ul>
          </div>
     </div>
</InfoLayout>
